OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft exhibition has stay
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary exhibition showcasing the
OL,7,Fchronicles of Tomb Raider has proved so
OL,8,Fpopular it will run for a year.
OL,10,FTreasures from the franchise went on
OL,11,Fdisplay at Pickford's House in Derby to
OL,12,Fmark the 30-year anniversary of the
OL,13,Fbirth of Lara Croft in July.
OL,15,FThe museum is located a short walk from
OL,16,Fthe studio in Ashbourne Road where game
OL,17,Fdesigners created the
OL,18,Farchaeologist-adventurer who would go
OL,19,Fon to conquer the world.
