OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft exhibition has stay
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe free Lara Croft: 30 Years On
OL,7,Fexhibition, which features
OL,8,Fcollectibles, costumes and rare
OL,9,Fartefacts including the computer used
OL,10,Fby Core Design to bring the legend to
OL,11,Flife, was initially set to run until
OL,12,FNovember.
